    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "The Sanguinor",
    "summary": "Your army gets one use in the battle. From round 2 onward, once the opposing [Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) is over, you may pick one enemy that completed a [charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move) during it. You may bring in the Sanguinor with an [Ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move), arriving in [engagement](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) with the chosen unit. The Sanguinor retains its eligibility for further movement.",
